 to reflect the fixed state of the four audited flows,\n  with each previously-failed criterion revised to its corrected conformance\n  level and support notes matching the implemented behavior.\n- The product documentation's accessibility statement is updated and\n  republished.\n- The updated content is technically reviewed against the implemented\n  keyboard fixes, with the review sign-off recorded, before publication.\n- The published documents make no conformance claims beyond the implemented\n  fixes (no claims covering screen-reader semantics beyond the keyboard work\n  or flows outside the four audited ones).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-3 (P2)** — The accessibility conformance documentation (VPAT and\n  product docs accessibility statement) is updated and republished to reflect\n  the fixed state, with technical review: covered in full by this epic's\n  scope.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26197,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-97fb1fb4ecf1dbad","agent_id":"a94a72592b85fae6b","session_id":"5c3c65cc-0035-4892-89e3-f0c9961f403f","uuid":"e1f480bb-6e18-4e02-b599-0e37ba45e6e6","timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:21:27.796Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9017"}
